      "notes": "Realtime: RoomKey built from session.Tenant.TenantId, never the envelope. Control plane: read/delete derive tenant from the stored record, not the route. Redis: every key embeds escaped tenant. GAP: IPC envelope carries no TenantId/RoomKey (parent-side discipline only)."
    },
